# Cloudflare Workers static-asset upload: gitignore-style exclusions.
# Keeps the deployed site to the page, the fonts, the service worker and
# the manifest; the Codex source, the Worker source, the build tooling and
# the maintainer docs stay on GitHub rather than becoming loose
# web-accessible files with no index.
CLAUDE.md
README.md
codex/
tools/
src/
roblox-reference.md
